  Obtain it from https://mano.is.tue.mpg.de/ and accept its licence.
- MediaPipe Hand Landmarker model (models/hand_landmarker.task): distributed
  by Google under the MediaPipe model terms; download with
  `scripts/download_models.py`.
- RTMDet/RTMPose ONNX weights (models/*.onnx): optional, sourced from the
  OpenMMLab ecosystem; check their licence before redistribution.
- ORB-SLAM3 and manopth (third_party/): GPL-3.0. They are used as external
  dependencies and are not part of this repository.
- SHOW3D toolkit (tools/show3d): CC BY-NC 4.0, non-commercial use only.
